# The discard is part of the cost (CR 602.2b), so with an empty hand the ability is not offered: Bot1 casts five Moxen, a Mountain and the Meower on turn 1,
# emptying its hand, and the refusal holds. On turn 3, with the card drawn in hand, it is the positive control: the ability is activated, discarding that card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Masked Meower
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Plains
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Masked Meower.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
! Bot1.Battlefield.Masked Meower.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Masked Meower.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Discard 1 card)
Bot1.Choose(Plains)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Hand.Count = 1
